# Format pasted raw recipes

**When this applies:** User pastes a raw recipe (plain text) and asks to format it, or user creates/edits a file in `_recipes/` or `_components/`.

**Do not change** the recipe itself: only structure, spelling, and conventions. All text stays in French.

## Recipe structure

- **Frontmatter (YAML):** `layout: recipe`, `title: "Titre"` (quoted, proper accents), `image: slug.ext` (filename only). Then `tags:`, `ingredients:`, `directions:` as lists (one item per line, hyphen + space). Optional `components:` list (component titles).
- **After `---`:** Short description. Optionally: "Pour X personnes", "Temps de préparation : …", "Temps de cuisson : …".

## Tags

Reuse existing tag vocabulary from other recipes. Same granularity: dish type (`repas`, `dessert`, `entrée`, `soupe`, `plat principal`, `apéritif`, `boisson`), category (`gratin`, `velouté`, `frit`, `marinade`, `gâteau`, `bouillon`), main ingredients (`beurre`, `chocolat`, `œufs`, `poulet`, `oignon`, `crème`), origins (`bocuse`, `sestu`, `emilia`, `marmiton`, `japon`, `voyage`), traits (`facile`, `rapide`, `chaud`, `gourmand`, `classique`, `traditionnel`). Lowercase; avoid new near-duplicates.

## Components

If the recipe has sub-recipes (sauce, bouillon, etc.): create `_components/nom_composant.md` with the same frontmatter/body format. Reference in the main recipe by **exact title** under `components:` (e.g. `- Dashi`, `- Sauce aromatique pour Karaage`). Component filename = snake_case from title (e.g. `aromatic_sauce_for_karaage.md`).

## French and spelling

Fix spelling only (e.g. "Céléri" → "Céleri", "souce" → "sauce"). Do not alter quantities, steps, or intent.

## Example (frontmatter)

```yaml
---
layout: recipe
title: "Velouté d'asperges"
image: veloute_asperges.jpeg

tags:
- repas
- soupe
- asperges
- crème
- chaud

ingredients:
- 600 g d'asperges vertes
- 1 oignon moyen

directions:
- Eplucher les asperges, les laver. Couper les pointes en lamelles.
- Mettre à bouillir 1 litre d'eau salée ; y mettre les asperges. Laisser cuire 15 à 20 minutes.
---
```

## Example (components)

In recipe: `components:` list with exact titles, e.g. `- Dashi`, `- Sauce aromatique pour Karaage`. Each component lives in `_components/` with same structure (e.g. `_components/dashi.md`, `_components/aromatic_sauce_for_karaage.md`).
